5
00:00:16.548 --> 00:00:20.198
Future. Say it with me. Future!

6
00:00:23.683 --> 00:00:26.867
Goals. Say it with me. Goals!

7
00:00:30.383 --> 00:00:33.967
Habits. Say it with me. Habits!

8
00:00:37.464 --> 00:00:41.747
Nutrition. Say it with me. Nutrition!

9
00:00:45.243 --> 00:00:48.860
Activity. Say it with me. Activity!

10
00:00:52.345 --> 00:00:56.079
Mental health. Say it with me. Mental health!

11
00:00:59.577 --> 00:01:03.177
Choices. Say it with me. Choices!

12
00:01:06.679 --> 00:01:09.812
Plan. Say it with me. Plan!

13
00:01:13.368 --> 00:01:26.361
My healthy future depends on the habits and choices I make now. Good nutrition, regular activity, and caring for my mental health all matter. A plan helps me reach my goals.

14
00:01:26.411 --> 00:01:27.918
I can do that too!

15
00:01:28.873 --> 00:01:34.206
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:34.256 --> 00:01:35.406
Habits!

17
00:01:36.337 --> 00:01:41.762
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:41.812 --> 00:01:42.962
Choices!

19
00:01:43.956 --> 00:01:49.638
Did you know? Many healthy habits formed in childhood can last a lifetime!

20
00:01:49.688 --> 00:01:51.667
